        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Single Cylinder Rectangular Deadbolt for Extra Thick Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis modern deadbolt is for use on <b>2-1/4 inch - 4 inch thick doors or gates</b>. It has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Thick Door Rectangular Deadbolt is a single cylinder lock, meaning that the deadbolt is locked and unlocked through the use of a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. The modern look of this single cylinder deadbolt makes it the perfect addition to any contemporary space.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\nOther style <a href=\"/collections/thick-door-locks\"><b>Thick Door Locks</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Extra Thick Door Rectangular Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5, 2001, Grade 1 auxiliary lock.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li>Has an anti-pick shield around the cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder and trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DB60CEN/61073 Extra Thick Door Rectangular Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4-5/32\" (4.15\")</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-27/32\" (2.84\")</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 2-1/4\" to 4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8” or 2-3/4”</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8” x 2-3/4”, 1/4” radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: 5-pin, C Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: For use with <b>2-1/4\" to 4\" Thick Doors</b>. For standard 1-3/4\" thick doors use the <a href=\"/products/century-single-cylinder-deadbolt-schlage-b60cen\"><b>Rectangular Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
